      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "AHS installers broke tiles resulting in water leaks and damage (clearly outsourced installers)We complained, but they never returned.The actual electrician did arrive and rectify the poor work done by the installers, but only after saying we would report the works to ombudsmen.First noticed problems 12 months in with reduced production, over time various panel/inverter units reduced production or failed, we did try contacting AHS, Tindo, Solarbridge, each would duck show us to the other, No one followed thru, we couldn't even get the promised monitoring app connected.Since first trying to find a fix over 2.5 years ago most panels/inverters failed with the system managed not even registering 9 of 20, AHS closed, and Tindo have promised to fix things, have had an electrician attend for under an hour once in 5 months......Tindo flyer promises a 25yr performance guarantee !So much for an Australian company",
